options.autojump.description=Enables automatically jumping when the player walks near a block with a block of air above.
options.fullkeyboardgameplay.description=Allows player to play the game using only keyboard keys.
options.hidetooltips.description=Toggles to hide the controller hints.
options.hidegamepadcursor.description=Toggles to hide the controller cursor.
options.clearhotbar.description=Enables the use of a button to instantly clear the player's hotbar while in inventory.
options.swapGamepadAB.description=Changes whether to swap the position of the A and B buttons.
options.swapGamepadXY.description=Changes whether to swap the position of the X and Y buttons.
options.gamepadcursorsensitivity.description=Adjusts the sensitivity of the controller's cursor in GUI's.
options.resizableUI.description=Enables a menu where the position, opacity and size of individual buttons can be changed. Touch controls can only be customized while loaded into a world.
options.lefthanded.description=Mirrors all buttons and objects for touch controls.
options.showActionButton.description=Toggles whether buttons or the touchscreen are used to interact with blocks and items.
options.sprintOnMovement.description=Enables players to sprint by holding the joystick forward.
options.showToggleCameraPerspectiveButton.description=Shows a button that can change the camera perspective.
options.joystickVisibilityOption.description=Changes the joystick's visibility.
options.thumbstickOpacity.description=Adjusts the joystick's opacity.
options.sneakOption.description=Toggles whether to tap the sneak button once to sneak, or to hold it down to sneak.
options.buttonSize.description=Changes the size of the controls.
options.destroyVibration.description=Toggles vibration when destroying blocks.
options.splitVibration.description=Toggles vibration when splitting item stacks in a GUI.
options.creativeDelayedBlockBreaking.description=Toggles whether blocks require a longer press to break in Creative mode.
options.alwaysHighlightHoveringBoxInCrosshair.description=Determines whether blocks are always highlighted by the crosshair, or if they are highlighted only when tapped.
options.usetouchpad.description=Chooses whether to use the touchscreen to interact throughout the screen or use a crosshair.
options.swapJumpAndSneak.description=Chooses whether to swap the position of jump and sneak buttons.
options.hotbarOnlyTouch.description=Chooses whether to use touch for the hotbar only. This option is intended for playing with controllers.
options.dwellbeforedragtime.description=Adjusts the amount of time to dwell before dragging items.
options.stacksplittingtriggertime.description=Adjusts the amount of time to trigger stack splitting.

options.gamma.description=Adjusts the game's brightness.
options.thirdperson.description=Toggles first/third person view. Third person view allows the player to view the nearby environment from an "outside" perspective.
options.fullscreen.description=Puts Minecraft into Fullscreen mode; keeping it off keeps it in a window.
options.hidehand.description=Shows or hides the player hand in first person view.
options.hidepaperdoll.description=Toggles the side-view of the player displayed in the top-left corner of the screen.
options.hidehud.description=Shows/Hides the HUD.
options.screenAnimations.description=Toggles the animations when switching between UI or menus.
options.interfaceOpacity.description=Toggles the opacity of the HUD. Choosing item on hotbar or interacting with UI will temporarily revert the opacity back to 100% . This option won't affect Paper Doll opacity.
options.fov.description=Changes the field of view. Controls how much of the game world is visible on the screen.
options.splitscreen.description=Toggles between the horizontal and vertical orientation of the splitscreen.
options.showautosaveicon.description=Hides/Shows the autosave indicator icon. The indicator icon shows on HUD when the game is attempting to automatically save your world to device storage.
options.classic_box_selection.description=Toggles the outline selection of the block. Disabling this will instead use highlight selection of the block.
options.ingamePlayerNames.description=Toggles the name tag text visibility that can be seen on top of players' head, mobs and NPCs.
options.splitscreenIngamePlayerNames.description=Toggles the name tag text visibility that can be seen on top of players' head, mobs and NPCs, while in split screen.
options.viewBobbing.description=Toggles the "bobbing" motion of the camera as the player is walking.
options.screenShake.description=Toggles screen shake when maps use the "/camerashake" commands. Disabling this option prevents the game from screen shaking when the commands are executed.
options.transparentleaves.description=Toggles transparent leaves.
options.bubbleparticles.description=Toggles the fancy water bubble columns graphics. This may lower performance on some devices.
options.renderclouds.description=Toggles the clouds graphics. Disabling this option causes no clouds to be rendered.
options.fancyskies.description=Toggles the sun, moon, clouds, stars and sky color. Disabling this option will not render them in the world and instead only sky color is rendered.
options.smooth_lighting.description=Lighting is smoothed across the blocks (ambient occlusion) or each block has a distinctive light level.
options.graphicsMode.description=Changes the graphics mode.
options.graphicsMode.simple.description=Simple graphics reduce quality graphic effects, disable transparent leaves and clouds for better performance.
options.graphicsMode.fancy.description=Fancy graphics enable higher quality graphic effects, including transparent leaves, transparent clouds.
options.graphicsMode.deferred.description=Deferred graphics enable realistic lighting, vibrant colors, reflective water, emissive textures without ray tracing and is data driven.
options.graphicsMode.rayTraced.description=Ray traced graphics enables even higher graphic effects, including realistic lighting, vibrant colors, reflective water and emissive textures. Only available on some supported ray tracing capable devices.
options.graphicsModeSwitch.description=Toggles whether the graphics mode can be changed while in-game for "a better stability".
options.graphicsQualityPresetMode.description=Choose your preferred quality preset. Select "Favor Performace" for a better experience on lower-end devices. Select "Favor Visuals" for a higher quality experience on higher-end devices.
options.fov.toggle.description=Toggles whether gameplay affects FOV changes, when sprinting, when having slowness or speed effect, etc.
options.guiScale.description=Controls the Graphical User Interface scale. This also controls the HUD size.
options.uiprofile.description=Changes the game UI style between classic (Desktop UI) and Pocket UI. Classic UI has Java-like UI style, while Pocket UI has bigger item slots, redesigned screens, more user-friendly to mobile devices.
options.raytracing.description=Toggles the ray tracing on or off.
options.upscaling.description=Enables NVIDIA DLSS 2.0 to boost frame rates on GeForce RTX graphics cards and support higher than 1080 resolutions.
options.deferredRenderDistance.description=Controls how many chunks of the world are visible at once if "Vibrant Visuals" option is on. This also affects the render distance of foliage such as transparent leaves, crops and animated textures.
options.raytracingRenderDistance.description=Controls how many chunks of the world are visible at once if "Ray Tracing" option is on. This also affects the render distance of foliage such as transparent leaves, crops and animated textures.
options.renderDistance.description=Controls how many chunks of the world are visible at once. This also affects the render distance of foliage such as transparent leaves, crops and animated textures.
options.maxFramerate.description=Limits the framerates per second. Limiting the framerate to a multiple of the player monitor's refresh rate can save processing power.
options.msaa.description=Toggles the amount of anti-aliasing, which smoothes the image and removes jagged edges.
options.texelAA.description=Toggles texture pixel anti-aliasing, which smoothes the pixels of blocks.
options.vsync.description=Limits the framerates per second to the screen's refresh rate. Set to No Vertical Sync or Adaptive will increase FPS higher than player monitor's refresh rate but negatively affect processing power.
options.shadowQuality.description=Changes the quality of shadows created by blocks and entities.
options.cloudQuality.description=Changes the quality of clouds and their shadows.
options.volumetricFogQuality.description=Changes the quality of volumetric fog.
options.reflectionsQuality.description=Changes the quality of reflections on blocks and water.
options.bloomStrengthSlider.description=Adjusts the amount of bloom.
options.upscalingMode.description=Changes the upscaling mode.
options.upscalingPercentage.description=Adjusts the resolution of upscaling graphics.

options.copyCoordinateUI.description=Shows feet and facing coordinates in the chat menu, as well as a button to copy them.
